{% comment %}
  OGÉ Fine Jewelry - Privacy Policy Template
  Matches privacy-policy.html
{% endcomment %}

<article class="legal-page-wrap">
  <h1 class="legal-page__title">{{ page.title | default: 'PRIVACY POLICY' }}</h1>

  <div class="legal-page__body">
    {% if page.content != blank %}
      {{ page.content }}
    {% else %}
      <p><strong>Last updated: September 2026</strong></p>

      <p>
        At OGÉ Jewelry, we value your privacy and are committed to protecting the personal information you share with us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your information when you visit or make a purchase through our website.
      </p>

      <h2>1. INFORMATION WE COLLECT</h2>
      <p>When you visit our website, place an order, create an account, subscribe to our newsletter, or contact us, we may collect information such as:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your name</li>
        <li>Email address</li>
        <li>Phone number</li>
        <li>Billing and shipping address</li>
        <li>Payment and transaction information</li>
        <li>Order history</li>
        <li>Information you provide when contacting us</li>
        <li>Device, browser, and website usage information</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We only collect information that is reasonably necessary to provide and improve our services.</p>

      <h2>2. HOW WE USE YOUR INFORMATION</h2>
      <p>We may use your information to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Process and deliver your orders</li>
        <li>Communicate with you about your orders</li>
        <li>Respond to enquiries and customer service requests</li>
        <li>Send order confirmations and important updates</li>
        <li>Provide information about new collections, products, or offers where you have opted in</li>
        <li>Improve our website, products, and customer experience</li>
        <li>Prevent fraud, unauthorized transactions, and misuse of our website</li>
        <li>Meet applicable legal and regulatory requirements</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>3. PAYMENT INFORMATION</h2>
      <p>
        Payments made through our website are processed through secure third-party payment providers. OGÉ Jewelry does not store your complete payment card details on our servers.
      </p>
      <p>
        Your payment information is handled according to the privacy and security practices of the payment provider used for your transaction.
      </p>

      <h2>4. COOKIES</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may use cookies and similar technologies to help the website function properly, remember your preferences, understand how visitors use our website, and improve your shopping experience.
      </p>
      <p>
        You may be able to control or disable cookies through your browser settings. Some features of the website may not function properly if cookies are disabled.
      </p>

      <h2>5. SHARING YOUR INFORMATION</h2>
      <p>We do not sell or rent your personal information.</p>
      <p>
        We may share necessary information with trusted service providers who help us operate our business, including payment processors, shipping and delivery providers, website and technology providers, and marketing or analytics services.
      </p>
      <p>
        These providers only receive information necessary to perform the services they provide to us.
      </p>

      <h2>6. DATA SECURITY</h2>
      <p>
        We take reasonable measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized access, misuse, alteration, or disclosure.
      </p>
      <p>
        However, no online transmission or electronic storage system can be guaranteed to be completely secure.
      </p>

      <h2>7. MARKETING COMMUNICATIONS</h2>
      <p>
        If you subscribe to our newsletter or marketing communications, you may receive updates about new collections, special offers, events, and other OGÉ Jewelry news.
      </p>
      <p>
        You can unsubscribe from marketing emails at any time by using the unsubscribe link included in the email or by contacting us.
      </p>

      <h2>8. THIRD-PARTY LINKS</h2>
      <p>
        Our website may contain links to third-party websites or platforms. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of those websites.
      </p>
      <p>
        We encourage you to review their privacy policies before providing personal information.
      </p>

      <h2>9. YOUR PRIVACY RIGHTS</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on applicable law, you may have rights regarding the personal information we hold about you, including the right to request access, correction, or deletion of your information.
      </p>
      <p>
        To make a privacy-related request, please contact us using the details below.
      </p>

      <h2>10. CHILDREN'S PRIVACY</h2>
      <p>
        Our website is not intended for children. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.
      </p>

      <h2>11. CHANGES TO THIS POLICY</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes to our business, website, or legal requirements.
      </p>
      <p>
        Any updates will be posted on this page with a revised "Last updated" date.
      </p>

      <h2>12. CONTACT US</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how your information is handled, please contact:</p>
      <p>
        <strong>OGÉ Jewelry</strong><br>
        Email: <a href="mailto:oge@ogejewelry.com">oge@ogejewelry.com</a><br>
        Website: ogejewelry.com
      </p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</article>

<hr class="legal-page-divider">
